WEBVTT

0
00:00:00.779 --> 00:00:03.970
Let's start with the process for warm transferring the caller,

1
00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.369
no questions asked.

2
00:00:07.309 --> 00:00:09.060
Thank you for calling member services.

3
00:00:09.189 --> 00:00:10.310
My name is Natasha.

4
00:00:10.510 --> 00:00:11.859
May I have your first and last name,

5
00:00:11.949 --> 00:00:12.489
please?

6
00:00:12.949 --> 00:00:13.340
Hi,

7
00:00:13.550 --> 00:00:16.000
will you please transfer me to the enhanced member support unit?

8
00:00:16.690 --> 00:00:17.079
Yes,

9
00:00:17.129 --> 00:00:17.809
absolutely.

10
00:00:17.930 --> 00:00:19.610
I'd be happy to transfer you over.

11
00:00:19.889 --> 00:00:22.389
Do you mind if I place you on a brief hold for just a moment?

12
00:00:22.809 --> 00:00:23.469
No problem.

13
00:00:23.969 --> 00:00:24.409
Thank you.

14
00:00:24.569 --> 00:00:24.969
One moment,

15
00:00:25.049 --> 00:00:25.489
please.

16
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:30.879
Navigate to the phone panel to place the caller on hold.

17
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:37.029
Once the caller is on hold,

18
00:00:37.369 --> 00:00:39.250
select the warm transfer tab,

19
00:00:39.529 --> 00:00:42.009
then search EMSU in the search bar.

20
00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:44.630
Select the correct transfer number from the list

21
00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.229
and press the green call button.

22
00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.279
Wait for the EMSU agent to answer.

23
00:00:57.590 --> 00:00:58.619
Thank you for calling

24
00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.159
Enhanced member support unit.

25
00:01:02.700 --> 00:01:03.159
Hi there,

26
00:01:03.220 --> 00:01:06.220
I have a caller that requested to be transferred to EMSU.

27
00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:10.160
Do you have their name or any additional information about the caller?

28
00:01:10.699 --> 00:01:11.559
I do not.

29
00:01:11.980 --> 00:01:12.339
OK,

30
00:01:12.459 --> 00:01:14.339
go ahead and complete the transfer now.

31
00:01:14.660 --> 00:01:14.940
OK,

32
00:01:15.019 --> 00:01:15.459
thank you.

33
00:01:17.290 --> 00:01:20.989
Click the transfer button in the phone panel to complete the warm transfer.